  "description": "You’ve never had pumpkin quite like this before! Coating pumpkin wedges with honey then roasting them until\ngolden makes the perfect accompaniment for tasty haloumi. Add a crisp apple salad and a herby mayo to\nround out this low-carb meal.\nThis recipe is under 650kcal per serving.",
