  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Slice\n• the butternut pumpkin into thin wedges. Place\n• the pumpkin on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with\n• olive oil and the honey and season with salt. Toss\n• to coat, then roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-18f5f345.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pumpkin is baking, slice the apple\n• (see ingredients) into thin sticks. In a small bowl,\n• combine the dill & parsley mayonnaise with a\n• small splash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-4056b58a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat the haloumi dry. In a medium bowl, combine the haloumi,\n• Aussie spice blend, a drizzle of olive oil and a\n• pinch of pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-e3ef766f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the pumpkin has 10 minutes remaining,\n• heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of olive oil\n• over a medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until\n• golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-5f782043.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the haloumi is cooking, in a large bowl, combine\n• the balsamic vinegar with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add the apple and deluxe salad mix. Season, then\n• toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-b157f25c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice the haloumi and divide between plates\n• with the pumpkin wedges and apple salad. Sprinkle the\n• flaked almonds over the pumpkin. Drizzle with the\n• dill & parsley mayonnaise and serve the remainder\n• on the side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60f76fb9eb2fcd5b5029f20a/step-7c8cf074.jpg"
    }
  ]
